&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of JDK internals: modules, the Java memory model, garbage collection, database load, caching techniques, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with observability and telemetry solutions, particularly OpenTelemetry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Go&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of containers and Kubernetes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Java build tools (Gradle, Maven, etc), with a strong preference for Gradle experience.&lt;/li&gt;
